  "description": "STM32 UART bootloader flasher (ST AN3155): a pure planner, an AN3155 shell over the CallAndResponse Stm32BootloaderClient, and an IFirmwareProgrammer / IBootloaderProvider adapter. Drives the system bootloader over a serial port - sync, extended erase, write, read-back verify, and Go - on a part already in system-bootloader mode. ADR-0061.",
